From 5b7b161ad3315053bfc76cac9c013e66866ebede Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bob <robertramsay78@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:29:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Animate: Fire animations - the player's animations while it
 holds fire

A 'With Fire' layer on the Animate page: one animation for fire with no
direction and one for fire + each of the 8 directions (digging, shooting,
swinging). The engine picks them from the joystick while the player holds
fire (A_AMODE bit 1, table entries 12-20); empty ones borrow from the other
Fire directions, turned round when 'Turn to face left' is on. Test mode:
Space, Ctrl or the gamepad's A button is fire. Checked in FS-UAE.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BQFSzGarhTTpK2DHf8XzFr
